<title>INDIA: India's Clutch Auto 96/97 net falls.</title>
<headline>India's Clutch Auto 96/97 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>Net profit 21.52 v 22.77</p>
<p>		  Sales 598.80 v 461.50 </p>
<p>    Provision for tax 5.96   vs    Nil</p>
<p>    Interest	   29.90   vs   22.23</p>
<p>    Depreciation     11.00   vs    8.20</p>
<p>    Expenditure     538.90   vs  416.30</p>
<p>NOTE: Clutch Auto, one of India's largest manufacturers of clutch assemblies, said its earning per share (EPS) in 1996/97 (April-March) stood at 2.89 rupees. It did not give the comparative EPS figure for the previous year.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
